<section class="px-5 md:px-30 py-9 md:py-16 bg-action text-on-action"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-[26px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 md:gap-4"><span class="hidden md:block"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">LAST THING</p></span><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">It is not going to fix itself.</h2><p class="text-[14.5px] md:text-[19px] leading-[1.55] opacity-[0.78]"><span class="md:hidden">Get the flat price. Do not like the number? You lost ninety seconds.</span><span class="hidden md:inline">Get the flat price. If you do not like the number you have lost ninety seconds and paid nothing at all.</span></p></div><div class="hidden md:block"><form method="post" action="/quote" class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-center"><select class="w-full rounded-[9px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent" name="job" required=true><option value="blocked_drain">Blocked drain</option><option value="burst_pipe">Burst or leaking pipe</option><option value="hot_water">Hot water</option><option value="tap_toilet">Tap, toilet or cistern</option><option value="sewer_line">Sewer line</option><option value="leak_detection">Leak detection</option><option value="repipe">Whole-house repipe</option><option value="fit_out">Bathroom or kitchen fit-out</option><option value="other">Something else</option></select><input class="w-full rounded-[9px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent" type="text" name="zip" placeholder="ZIP code" required=true/><input class="w-full rounded-[9px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent" type="tel" name="mobile" placeholder="Mobile number" required=true/><button type="submit" class="shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-inverse-deep px-[34px] py-[18px] font-display text-[18px] font-semibold text-on-inverse">Send me my price  →</button></form></div><a href="tel:+15035550148" class="md:hidden w-full rounded-[9px] bg-inverse-deep py-4 text-center font-display text-[16px] font-semibold text-on-inverse">Call (503) 555-0148</a><p class="hidden md:block text-[16px] font-medium opacity-80">Or call (503) 555-0148 — 24 hours, answered by a human in Portland. Average pickup: 11 seconds.</p></div></section>
